{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"change_kind\":\"DECOMPOSITION\",\"children\":[{\"assumptions\":[\"The filing entity is within the circular's defined licensed-firm categories.\",\"The assessed event is an actual STR submission to the JFIU.\",\"The event timestamp is interpreted in the timezone governing the circular's stated launch and blackout times.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u0.0\"},{\"quote\":\"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2.\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\"}],\"distinction\":\"This child isolates scope and launch timing from the unresolved e-Cert mechanics.\",\"family\":\"scope\",\"formalization\":{\"facts\":[{\"meaning\":\"The filing entity is a licensed firm within the circular's defined categories.\",\"name\":\"is_licensed_firm\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u0.0\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The assessed event is an actual submission of an STR to the JFIU.\",\"name\":\"is_str_submission_event\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u2.795\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The event occurred on or after the STREAMS 2 effective date.\",\"name\":\"event_on_or_after_2026_02_02\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"}],\"result\":\"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] (and is_licensed_firm is_str_submission_event event_on_or_after_2026_02_02)\",\"result_type\":\"bool\",\"scope\":\"Boolean\"},\"local_id\":\"scope_and_effective_date\",\"questions\":[\"What evidence establishes the submitting entity's classification within the circular's licensed-firm categories?\",\"What is the event timestamp, and which timezone governs the stated launch and blackout times?\"],\"statement\":\"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] The scope and effective-date prerequisites are satisfied only when the submitting entity is an in-scope licensed firm, the event is an actual STR submission, and the event occurred on or after 2 February 2026.\" ,\"subject\":\"Licensed-firm scope and STREAMS 2 effective date\"},{\"assumptions\":[\"The selected event used exactly one of the three listed STREAMS 2 submission means.\",\"For XML or prescribed-PDF submissions, the footnote 3 requirement applies to that submission.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\"},{\"quote\":\"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003\"},{\"quote\":\"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078\"},{\"quote\":\"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149\"}],\"distinction\":\"This child formalizes the channel and method alternatives while leaving the certificate relationship as a separate authority question.\",\"family\":\"scope\",\"formalization\":{\"facts\":[{\"meaning\":\"The event was submitted through STREAMS 2.\",\"name\":\"submitted_via_streams2\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The event used XML submission.\",\"name\":\"method_xml\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The event uploaded a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format.\",\"name\":\"method_prescribed_pdf\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The event completed the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.\",\"name\":\"method_web_form\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean\"}],\"result\":\"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] (and submitted_via_streams2 (or method_xml method_prescribed_pdf method_web_form))\",\"result_type\":\"bool\",\"scope\":\"Boolean\"},\"local_id\":\"streams2_method_alternatives\",\"questions\":[\"Was this an actual STR submission to the JFIU, and which channel and method did this particular event use?\",\"For a PDF event, which prescribed form applied, was it completed, and was that completed form uploaded?\"],\"statement\":\"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] The selected event satisfies the listed-method condition when it was submitted through STREAMS 2 and used XML, prescribed-PDF upload, or the web-based form.\" ,\"subject\":\"STREAMS 2 channel and listed submission method\"},{\"assumptions\":[\"The footnote applies to XML and prescribed-PDF submissions as marked in the circular.\",\"No certificate-holder, signing, authentication, attachment, or validity condition is inferred without further authority.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569\"}],\"distinction\":\"The source states that an e-Cert is required for the marked submission but does not specify the operational relation that makes the requirement satisfied.\",\"family\":\"dependencies\",\"formalization\":null,\"local_id\":\"ecert_operational_relationship\",\"questions\":[\"What operational relationship between a Hongkong Post e-Cert and an XML or PDF submission satisfies footnote 3?\",\"Do the applicable technical requirements impose certificate-holder, authorization or validity conditions, and if so, what are they?\",\"What evidence establishes that relationship for this event?\"],\"statement\":\"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] The XML or prescribed-PDF branch cannot receive a complete compliance determination until authoritative information specifies how the required Hongkong Post e-Cert must be supplied or used. Certificate availability alone and any undefined satisfaction predicate are insufficient.\" ,\"subject\":\"Submission-specific Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement\"},{\"assumptions\":[\"The blackout urgent-contact instruction is a separate event classification from a STREAMS 2 submission.\",\"The retained text supplies no resubmission deadline.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941\"},{\"quote\":\"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\"}],\"distinction\":\"This child preserves the blackout contact exception and post-implementation resubmission obligation without merging them into the original submission event.\",\"family\":\"exceptions\",\"formalization\":null,\"local_id\":\"blackout_and_resubmission\",\"questions\":[\"If the STR required urgent submission during the blackout, what direct contact with the JFIU occurred through a listed method?\",\"Does the same STR have any post-implementation submission outside STREAMS 2, and what subsequent resubmission and JFIU guidance are evidenced?\"],\"statement\":\"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Blackout direct contact and any later resubmission are assessed as separate obligations; neither changes the original event's channel, method, or timestamp.\" ,\"subject\":\"Blackout urgent contact and separate resubmission obligation\"}],\"obligations\":[{\"child_ids\":[\"scope_and_effective_date\",\"streams2_method_alternatives\",\"ecert_operational_relationship\",\"blackout_and_resubmission\"],\"explanation\":\"The parent meaning is decomposed into scope/effective-date, method, unresolved e-Cert, and separate transitional-event components. The e-Cert child remains unresolved, so the parent cannot be settled by partial children.\",\"parent_item\":\"certificate_relation_challenge\",\"treatment\":\"UNRESOLVED\"}],\"original_hash\":\"e9834847b9c85d459c8580b61c349984c190650348028478fb87871e4b3fe408\",\"parent_relation\":\"Children refine the parent into independently assessable prerequisites and preserve the unresolved certificate dependency; no child alone settles the parent.\",\"residual_questions\":[\"What authoritative source defines the operational e-Cert relationship for XML and prescribed-PDF submissions?\",\"What event-specific evidence establishes scope, timestamp, method, form completion/upload, and any separate blackout contact or resubmission?\"]}"}}
